(1) at AM user cannot enter after 09:00 -> show error
(2) at PM user cannot enter after 14:00 -> show error
(3) at PM user cannot exit before 16:30, unless it's friday
(4) at AM user cannot exit before 12:00
(5) if a user makes less than 30 minutes of break between exit AM and enter PM, the count of hours is not incremented, 
e.g. user makes 20 minutes of pause, we don't add 10 minutes to the working hours, since they need to do at least 30 minutes
(6) exit PM for friday should be disabled, it makes no sense to fill it
(7) Style of the date picket should be improvedm currently it's the standard layout
(8) If I modify an input which will cause an error I get blocked before being able to fill it in, for example suppose I have exit 12:30 and 13:02 is filled, 
if in 13:02 in the hour part I type 1 I am blocked before being able to finish the input. This happens only if also the minutes are set